@startuml F3.2-ERRO-sem-event-host
title F3.2-ERRO — 403 sem event.host
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "EventController" as Ctrl

Prof -> WebApp: Abrir janela
WebApp -> Jwt: POST .../windows/entry
note right of Jwt
  event.host ausente
  EventController não executa
end note
Jwt --> WebApp: 403
WebApp --> Prof: acesso negado

@enduml
